(F5 T2 V5b: dof_limit needs two values per dof (here 1 dof, temp): a single
 value is an input error. The Professional 02-08-2026 (probe f5/v5b
 b_lim_short) stops with: Error in data part. Problem reading : dof_limit
 EXPECTED_ERROR: Problem reading : dof_limit
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2

condif_temperature
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 2 0
node 4 3 0
node 5 0 1
node 6 1 1
node 7 2 1
node 8 3 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 5 6
element 2 -quad4 2 3 6 7
element 3 -quad4 3 4 7 8
group_type 0  -condif

group_condif_density 0 1.
group_condif_capacity 0 1.
group_condif_conductivity 0 1.
bounda_dof 0 -ra 1 5 -ra -temp
bounda_time 0 0.
bounda_dof 1 -ra 4 8 -ra -temp
bounda_time 1 100.
dof_limit 10.
control_timestep 0 1. 1.
end_data
